[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3153694168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109317#issuecomment-3153694168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109317","id":3153694168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67-Y3Y","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T06:37:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T06:37:32Z","body":"> so I imagine this is the case for everybody\n\nNo, it's less than a second on my system, but a few seconds seems to be completely reasonable for a hardware info query like this.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3153694168/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156045893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109317#issuecomment-3156045893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109317","id":3156045893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68HXBF","user":{"login":"Chaosed0","id":2808430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDg0MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2808430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosed0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T17:44:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T17:49:16Z","body":"I disagree that it's reasonable. If this is system-dependent, then it is scary to me that this can take an unspecified amount of time based on some random player's system. Our team queries `get_video_adapter_driver_info` to place the info in the logs at startup for diagnosing issues (i.e. so we don't have to ask the player to run `dxdiag`). If I cannot trust this method to run in a short amount of time, I'd rather not use it at all.\n\nSubstituting DXGI for the query, [as referenced here](https://asawicki.info/news_1773_how_to_programmatically_check_graphics_driver_version), reduces the time taken down to about 100ms on my system, which is still not enough for real-time usage but much better for startup. I understand if this is not a dependency we'd want to add to the engine, but I still feel that this query should not take so long.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156045893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156054039","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109317#issuecomment-3156054039","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109317","id":3156054039,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68HZAX","user":{"login":"brcontainer","id":4368952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjg5NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4368952?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer","html_url":"https://github.com/brcontainer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T17:46:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T17:46:59Z","body":"It's likely due to the query `SELECT * FROM Win32_PnPSignedDriver WHERE DeviceName = \"...\"` ([os_windows.cpp#L689](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c81fd6c51233a727da528cf7f74137d56b5d6efe/platform/windows/os_windows.cpp#L689C49-L689C101)). Subsequent executions are faster because the result is cached.\n\nYou can try running:\n```sh\nPS C:\\> Get-WmiObject -Query \"SELECT * FROM Win32_PnPSignedDriver WHERE DeviceName = 'NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060'\"\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156054039/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156072386","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109317#issuecomment-3156072386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109317","id":3156072386,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68HdfC","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T17:53:49Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T17:54:19Z","body":"Can confirm on Windows 11, takes about two or three seconds","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156072386/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes"