sues/109317","id":3156074932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68HeG0","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T17:54:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T17:54:47Z","body":"It being on a thread will not run any faster, it would still block and would be no faster when running on a thread","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156074932/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156091180","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109317#issuecomment-3156091180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109317","id":3156091180,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68HiEs","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T18:00:55Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T18:05:21Z","body":"https://github.com/godot-extended-libraries/godot-debug-menu has moved the call of that method to a thread, as it was also pretty slow on Linux + NVIDIA (at least 0.5 seconds on an i9-13900K). In that add-on, the method isn't called at startup but when the debug menu is first shown, so moving it to a thread is a viable approach there.\n\n> I understand if this is not a dependency we'd want to add to the engine, but I still feel that this query should not take so long.\n\nWe already have Direct3D 12 support in official releases (or with the `d3d12=yes` SCons option), so it's probably fine to use now when using Direct3D 12. However, we will need to implement https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5692 for this to work with Vulkan first.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156091180/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156113868","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109317#issuecomment-3156113868","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109317","id":3156113868,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68HnnM","user":{"login":"Chaosed0","id":2808430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDg0MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2808430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosed0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T18:08:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T18:08:53Z","body":"Running on a thread is a fair solution for our use case. It would be nice for this log line to be at the top of our log so it's easy to find, but it doesn't necessarily have to be. Perhaps all that is needed here is to add documentation noting that the method may take a long time to call.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156113868/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156185346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109317#issuecomment-3156185346","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109317","id":3156185346,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68H5EC","user":{"login":"brcontainer","id":4368952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjg5NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4368952?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer","html_url":"https://github.com/brcontainer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T18:32:48Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T18:37:55Z","body":"> Perhaps all that is needed here is to add documentation noting that the method may take a long time to call.\n\nAdding documentation would be very helpful.\n\nAnother option would be to run `OS::get_singleton()->get_video_adapter_driver_info()` once on the **splash screen**, since the value will be cached later.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156185346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156189718","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109317#issuecomment-3156189718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues